      "statement": "create_deep_agent uses DeepAgentState as the base graph state schema when no custom state_schema is supplied; DeepAgentState extends AgentState and wraps messages with a DeltaChannel reducer so checkpoint growth is linear (O(N)) instead of quadratic (O(N^2)).",
